    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gradient Flow Is A Free-to-Play Minimalist Racing Game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the timer and your friends through leaderboards and online lobbies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradient Flow features a custom physics engine designed to provide the smoothest and the most consistent driving experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All playable racetracks are made using the in-game editor and players can easily share their creations and browse other players' creations.<br><br>Customize your wheel with the skins available in the in-game shop!<br>All microtransactions are purely cosmetic and do not give you any advantage in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
